    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      87.59,
      436.41,
      518.07,
      454.69
    ],
    "text": "would have occupied if the wrong order had not been made. It is a",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.76207160949707,
      13.300000190734863,
      13.360462188720703,
      13.372502326965332,
      13.719581604003906
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      87.29,
      456.58,
      518.07,
      494.78
    ],
    "text": "power which is inherent in the court itself, and rests on the principle that a court of justice is under a duty to repair the injury done to a",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.76207160949707,
      13.241068840026855,
      13.300000190734863,
      13.372502326965332,
      13.405431747436523,
      13.482941627502441,
      13.501326560974121,
      13.742779731750488,
      13.768692016601562
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      88.06,
      496.41,
      516.33,
      534.37
    ],
    "text": "party by its act. The duty of the court under these circumstances can be carried out under its inherent power.\"",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.170722007751465,
      13.300000190734863,
      13.34597110748291,
      13.353094100952148,
      13.372502326965332,
      13.60739803314209
    ]
