    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      122.14,
      146.01,
      518.23,
      184.21
    ],
    "text": "inherent powers of court to make order as may be necessary to meet the ends of justice or to prevent abuse of process of court.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.648808479309082,
      13.300000190734863,
      13.316988945007324,
      13.372502326965332,
      13.501326560974121,
      13.635664939880371,
      13.742779731750488,
      13.876840591430664
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      88.43,
      193.05,
      517.75,
      211.33
    ],
    "text": "It was further held in that case that mere setting aside of the decree",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
