    "bbox": [
      87.75,
      392.97,
      519.15,
      431.18
    ],
    "text": "had inadvertently made no order for the restoration of possession. The substituted-plaintiff had appealed from this order to the court of",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
